Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["getTBBandCorep", "ObjectName"], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], Cell[BoxData["getTBBandCorep[MSG,H,rules,kset]"], "InlineFormula"], "  ", "在每个给定的倒空间分数坐标 k 点输出 MSGCorep 能带共表示表。"}], "Usage"], Cell["先调用 getMSGElemFromMSGCorep[MSG]，再把它返回的有序操作列表原样传给 init；getTBBandCorep 只支持这条由 MSGCorep 生成操作的流程。", "Notes"], Cell["init 所选的局域基决定采用单值还是双值路线：标量 s 基采用单值表示，显式的 {sup,sdn} 旋量基采用双值表示。", "Notes"], Cell["kset 是由三分量倒空间分数坐标组成的非空列表。函数对每个 k 点输出一行名称和一个 Grid，并返回 Null；公开展示结果是 Grid，不是 Association。", "Notes"], Cell["必须先安装可选的 MSGCorep 与 SpaceGroupIrep，并在调用任一 MagneticTB 包装函数前由用户执行 Needs[\"MSGCorep`\"]。MagneticTB 不会自动加载 MSGCorep，也不会用内部近似替代其计算。", "Notes"], Cell["依赖未载入、当前 init 模型不兼容、H、rules 或 kset 格式错误，或者 MSGCorep 拒绝该模型时，getTBBandCorep 会给出消息并返回 $Failed；函数不会修补输入，也不会改用近似算法。", "Notes"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["范例初始化", "ExamplesInitializationSection"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MagneticTB`\"]"], "ExampleInitialization"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["基本范例", "PrimaryExamplesSection"], Cell["对 MSG {164,87} 初始化双值旋量模型，并输出 Gamma、K 和 A 点的共表示：", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MSGCorep`\"];\ncorepOperations = getMSGElemFromMSGCorep[{164, 87}];\ninit[\n  lattice -> {\n    {0, -a, 0},\n    {Sqrt[3] a/2, a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 2},\n  wyckoffposition -> {{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}},\n  symminformation -> corepOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"sup\", \"sdn\"}},\n  InitialBondShells -> 1,\n  GenerateSymmetryGroup -> False\n];\ncorepHamiltonian = symham[1];\ngetTBBandCorep[\n  {164, 87}, corepHamiltonian, {e1 -> 0},\n  {{0, 0, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}, {0, 0, 1/2}}\n]"], "Input"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["更多范例", "ExtendedExamplesSection", CellTags -> "ExtendedExamples"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["应用", "ExampleSection"], Cell["同一个非平凡磁群改用一个标量 s 轨道时，采用 MSGCorep 的单值路线：", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MSGCorep`\"];\ncorepOperations = getMSGElemFromMSGCorep[{164, 87}];\ninit[\n  lattice -> {\n    {0, -a, 0},\n    {Sqrt[3] a/2, a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 2},\n  wyckoffposition -> {{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}},\n  symminformation -> corepOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"s\"}},\n  InitialBondShells -> 1,\n  GenerateSymmetryGroup -> False\n];\ncorepHamiltonian = symham[1];\ngetTBBandCorep[\n  {164, 87}, corepHamiltonian, {e1 -> 0},\n  {{0, 0, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}, {0, 0, 1/2}}\n]"], "Input"]}, Open]]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["相关函数", "SeeAlsoSection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["getMSGElemFromMSGCorep", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/ref/getMSGElemFromMSGCorep"], " ▪ ", ButtonBox["orbitalTable", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/ref/orbitalTable"]}], "SeeAlso"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["相关指南", "MoreAboutSection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "MoreAbout"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["相关教程", "TutorialsSection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["使用 MSGCorep 计算能带共表示", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/tutorial/Corepresentations"]}], "Tutorials"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["历史", "HistorySection"], Cell[TextData[{"引入版本：", Cell["2.0.0", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "New"], " | 修改版本：", Cell[" ", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "Modified"], " | 废弃版本：", Cell[" ", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "Obsolete"]}], "History"]}, Closed]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["分类", "CategorizationSection"], Cell["Symbol", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Entity Type"], Cell["MagneticTB", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Paclet Name"], Cell["MagneticTB`", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Context"], Cell["MagneticTB/ref/getTBBandCorep", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "URI"]}, Closed]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["关键词", "KeywordsSection"], Cell["band corepresentation", "Keywords"], Cell["double group", "Keywords"], Cell["high-symmetry k point", "Keywords"]}, Closed]]}, TaggingRules -> <|"Paclet" -> "MagneticTB"|>, WindowTitle -> "get